{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019j1FutPeHPGBSsiiynrkJm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the research data carefully to define three tiers for the Dream simulation.\n\nKey existing data points:\n- NER SJ rho: ~0.38-0.39 (across pilots 003, 004, 005)\n- NER FK rho: ~0.26-0.34\n- SJ beats FK on NER: consistently true (+4-7pp)\n- RE full SJ rho: ~0.23-0.25 (consistently below 0.40)\n- RE cond SJ rho: ~0.30-0.37\n- RE SJ beats FK: inconsistent on full set, consistent on conditional\n\n\n- The critical test is exp-012: whether SJ outperforms log-probability baselines on NER, which will heavily influence the tier definitions\n\nI also need to account for several pending experiments—exact-match and entity-level voting baselines, cross-dataset generalization on CoNLL-2003 and WNUT-17, LLaMA validation, and additional metrics like AUROC and calibration—before finalizing the tier structure. The best-case scenario would have SJ clearly dominating all baselines on NER with strong cross-dataset performance.\n\nNow I'm thinking through the expected rho values for SJ across the three tiers: best case around 0.39-0.45, median case holding steady at 0.35-0.40, and worst case degrading to 0.30-0.38.\n\nThe critical comparison is log-prob—it could range anywhere from clearly inferior at 0.20-0.28 up to matching or beating SJ at 0.35-0.42, which would fundamentally change the narrative.\n\nFor cross-dataset replication on CoNLL and WNUT, I'm looking at whether the SJ > FK > log-prob ordering holds consistently or breaks down, with rho values potentially dipping below 0.30 in the worst scenario.\n\nOn best-of-N selection, SJ should deliver 3-5 percentage points of F1 gain over greedy in the best case, but this could compress to negligible differences if log-prob selection performs equally well.\n\nI'm also checking whether these patterns generalize to LLaMA or if they're model-specific artifacts, and examining AUROC and tau metrics to see if SJ maintains a clear advantage above 0.70 AUROC and 0.30 tau, or if those metrics degrade to the 0.60-0.70 and 0.22-0.30 ranges where the advantage becomes marginal.\n\nNow I need to structure the narrative and generate the YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13772,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13772},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef4710d3-fab0-4b73-a52a-52543dd9a357","uuid":"64f9e757-d1ff-4814-aa7d-065fdcd31c06"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019j1FutPeHPGBSsiiynrkJm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"SJ 在所有 NER 场景下显著优于全部 baseline（含 log-prob），Claim 1 原始 framing 完全成立，16x 推理成本有正当性\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"SJ 在 NER 上显著优于 log-prob（Δρ ≥ 0.08），结构一致性捕获了模型置信度之外的信息\"\n      - \"SJ > FK > exact-match 的排序在 CoNLL-2003 和 WNUT-17 上复现\"\n      - \"LLaMA-3.1-8B 上 SJ 优势复现（model-agnostic）\"\n      - \"Best-of-N 选择带来实质 F1 提升，SJ 选择显著优于 log-prob 选择\"\n      - \"AUROC / τ / calibration 多指标一致确认 SJ 最优\"\n      - \"RE 诊断故事（compound error propagation）在所有信号上一致成立\"\n    number_ranges:\n      ner_sj_rho_scierc: [0.39, 0.45]\n      ner_sj_rho_conll: [0.35, 0.45]\n      ner_sj_rho_wnut: [0.33, 0.42]\n      ner_logprob_rho: [0.20, 0.28]\n      ner_exact_match_rho: [0.15, 0.25]\n      ner_entity_voting_rho: [0.25, 0.33]\n      ner_sj_minus_logprob: [0.08, 0.20]\n      ner_sj_auroc: [0.70, 0.80]\n      ner_sj_tau: [0.28, 0.35]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_greedy: [3.0, 6.0]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_logprob: [1.5, 4.0]\n      llama_ner_sj_rho: [0.33, 0.43]\n      llama_sj_beats_logprob: true\n      re_full_all_signals_rho_max: [0.20, 0.30]\n      re_cond_sj_rho: [0.35, 0.42]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      原始 framing 完全成立。标题级 claim：set-aware self-consistency 是 IE test-time scaling \n      最优置信信号。核心贡献 = SJ 优于 log-prob 证明结构一致性捕获了模型内部置信度之外的互补信息，\n      16x 推理成本换来的信号质量提升值得。Claim 2 的 task-complexity boundary 作为\n      诊断性发现自然成立（所有信号在 RE 上都退化，不是 SJ 的问题）。\n      目标：EMNLP Main。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"SJ 优于 FK 和 exact-match，但与 log-prob 打平或仅微弱胜出；跨数据集/模型部分复现。需要重新定位贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"SJ 在 NER 上优于 FK（Δρ ≥ 0.04）和 exact-match，但 SJ 与 log-prob 差距不显著或仅微弱显著\"\n      - \"跨数据集部分复现：2/3 数据集 SJ > FK 成立，但 SJ vs log-prob 排序不一致\"\n      - \"LLaMA 上 SJ > FK 成立但优势缩小，或 SJ ≈ log-prob\"\n      - \"Best-of-N 选择有 F1 提升，但 SJ 选择与 log-prob 选择无显著差异\"\n      - \"多指标结果不一致：ρ 上 SJ 微优，但 AUROC 上 log-prob 可能持平或反超\"\n      - \"RE compound error 故事成立，但 log-prob 在 RE 上可能与 SJ 同样差或略好\"\n    number_ranges:\n      ner_sj_rho_scierc: [0.36, 0.42]\n      ner_sj_rho_conll: [0.28, 0.38]\n      ner_sj_rho_wnut: [0.25, 0.35]\n      ner_logprob_rho: [0.30, 0.38]\n      ner_exact_match_rho: [0.15, 0.25]\n      ner_entity_voting_rho: [0.25, 0.35]\n      ner_sj_minus_logprob: [-0.02, 0.08]\n      ner_sj_auroc: [0.62, 0.72]\n      ner_sj_tau: [0.22, 0.30]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_greedy: [1.5, 3.5]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_logprob: [-0.5, 1.5]\n      llama_ner_sj_rho: [0.28, 0.38]\n      llama_sj_beats_logprob: \"inconclusive\"\n      re_full_all_signals_rho_max: [0.22, 0.32]\n      re_cond_sj_rho: [0.30, 0.38]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 1 需降级：不能说 SJ 是\"最优\"信号，改为 SJ 是最优 consistency metric（优于 FK 和 exact-match），\n      且与零成本的 log-prob 互补而非替代。Reframe 贡献为 systematic comparison：\n      首次在结构化预测 TTS 中系统比较四类置信信号，发现 (a) 结构一致性优于表面一致性，\n      (b) log-prob 是意外强的 baseline 表明模型已内化了部分一致性信息，\n      (c) 两类信号可能捕获不同维度（可探索 ensemble）。Claim 2 不变，\n      且因 log-prob 在 RE 上同样退化而加强了 task-complexity boundary 的普适性。\n      补充 SJ+log-prob ensemble 实验作为新亮点。目标：EMNLP Main/Findings 均可。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"Log-prob 在 NER 上匹配甚至超过 SJ；跨数据集/模型复现失败；SJ 的 16x 成本完全不合理\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Log-prob 在 NER 上达到或超过 SJ（Δρ ≤ 0），单次前向传播即可获得同等或更优信号\"\n      - \"跨数据集不一致：CoNLL 或 WNUT 上 SJ 甚至不优于 FK，pilot 结果是 SciERC 特异性\"\n      - \"LLaMA 上 SJ 优势消失或排序反转，方法不 model-agnostic\"\n      - \"Best-of-N 选择中 log-prob 选择 ≥ SJ 选择，SJ 的计算开销无收益\"\n      - \"AUROC/calibration 指标上 log-prob 明确优于 SJ\"\n      - \"entity voting baseline 接近 SJ，进一步压缩 SJ 的增量价值\"\n    number_ranges:\n      ner_sj_rho_scierc: [0.33, 0.39]\n      ner_sj_rho_conll: [0.20, 0.30]\n      ner_sj_rho_wnut: [0.18, 0.28]\n      ner_logprob_rho: [0.35, 0.44]\n      ner_exact_match_rho: [0.18, 0.28]\n      ner_entity_voting_rho: [0.28, 0.38]\n      ner_sj_minus_logprob: [-0.12, -0.02]\n      ner_sj_auroc: [0.55, 0.65]\n      ner_sj_tau: [0.18, 0.26]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_greedy: [0.5, 2.0]\n      bestofN_f1_gain_sj_over_logprob: [-2.0, -0.3]\n      llama_ner_sj_rho: [0.20, 0.32]\n      llama_sj_beats_logprob: false\n      re_full_all_signals_rho_max: [0.24, 0.34]\n      re_cond_sj_rho: [0.28, 0.36]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      核心 framing 必须重写，但不降级 venue 目标。新 angle：本文是首个在结构化预测 TTS 中\n      系统评估置信信号的 empirical study，关键发现是负面但有高信息量的：\n      (1) log-prob 是被低估的强 baseline——多采样一致性（无论 SJ 还是 FK）在 NER 上\n      并不优于单次 log-prob，表明对于当前 LLM，模型内部置信度已充分编码输出质量信息，\n      额外采样是浪费；(2) 所有置信信号在 RE 上都退化，揭示了 task-complexity boundary；\n      (3) SJ 作为集合相似度度量在 consistency 族内仍优于 FK/exact-match，\n      是 consistency 方法的最佳实践，但 consistency 方法本身不优于 log-prob。\n      这是一个\"systematic negative result + diagnostic framework\"的贡献模式，\n      EMNLP 历史上接受此类 paper（calibration/evaluation 类 track）。\n      目标：仍冲 EMNLP Main，Findings 作为底线。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13772,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13772},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef4710d3-fab0-4b73-a52a-52543dd9a357","uuid":"c1bdf1e6-f48e-45b8-ba77-68d9721b948f"}
